  "title": "Ranch, Bacon, and Parmesan Pasta Salad",
  "description": "This tangy, crunchy-crisp, savory chilled ranch, bacon, and Parmesan pasta salad recipe is a flavorful change of pasta to the usual pasta side salad.",
